<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Print route invoices · D’ RAW</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/workspaces-assets/app.css"><style>body{max-width:950px;margin:auto;padding:20px}.card{background:white;padding:20px;border:1px solid #dcd4e6;border-radius:20px;margin:16px 0}label{display:block;margin:16px 0}select{display:block;min-height:48px}iframe{width:100%;height:75vh;border:0}.actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}li{margin:10px 0}a{color:#35116c}[hidden]{display:none!important}</style></head><body><a href="/warehouse-planning">← Route planning</a><h1>Print route invoices</h1><p id="message" role="status">Loading this route…</p><section id="setup" class="card" hidden><h2 id="title"></h2><p id="date"></p><label>Copies of each invoice<select id="copies"><option value="1">1 copy</option><option value="2" selected>2 copies</option><option value="3">3 copies</option></select></label><label>Invoice order<select id="order"><option value="stop">First stop to last stop</option><option value="reverse">Last stop to first stop</option></select></label><p>Each route starts with its driver loading reminder for fresh fruit and juices. Its invoice copies follow before the next route begins. Copies stay together: invoice A, invoice A, invoice B, invoice B. Multi-page invoices stay intact.</p><ol id="invoices"></ol><button id="prepare" class="primary">Prepare invoice bundle</button></section><section id="result" class="card" hidden><h2>Your route bundle</h2><p>Select <strong>Brother MFC-L2750DW</strong>, <strong>Letter</strong>, <strong>Fit to page</strong> and <strong>1 printer copy</strong>. Your requested invoice copies are already inside the PDF. Use single-sided printing to keep invoices separate.</p><div class="actions"><button id="print" class="primary">Print bundle</button><a id="download" download>Download PDF</a><a id="open" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open PDF</a></div><p id="details"></p><iframe id="preview" title="Route invoice PDF preview"></iframe></section><script type="module" src="/workspaces-assets/route-invoices.js"></script><script type="module" src="/workspaces-assets/office-notification.js"></script></body></html>
